| FeCN$_6^{4-}$ | 0            | +x | x |

The equilibrium constant is given by:
\[
K_{eq} = \frac{[\text{FeCN}_6^{4-}]}{[\text{Fe}^{3+}] [\text{CN}^-]^6} = 1.2 \times 10^{20}
\]
