5. **Process Control and Monitoring:**
   - Implement advanced process control systems to monitor and adjust operating conditions in real-time, ensuring optimal performance and minimizing variability.
   - Use advanced sensors and sensors to measure key parameters (e.g., temperature, pressure, gas composition) and provide feedback for process control.

