(b) $\int_{0}^{1}\left(3 e^{x}+2 \sqrt{x}\right) d x = \int_{0}^{1} 3 e^{x} + 2 x^{1/2} \, d x = 3 \int_{0}^{1} e^{x} \, d x + 2 \int_{0}^{1} x^{1/2} \, d x$.
\[
