\]

Given the current \( i(t) = 0.2e^{-4t} \, \text{A} \), the initial current at \( t = 0 \) is:
\[
I_0 = i(0) = 0.2e^{-4(0)} = 0.2e^0 = 0.2 \, \text{A}.
\]

