- Specific heat of gases \( c_g = 1.005 \, \text{kJ/kg K} \).  
- Latent heat of water \( L = 1858.5 \, \text{kJ/kg} \).  
- Mass of water \( m_w = 1 \, \text{kg} \).  

1. **Gas-specific heat:**  
   The heat lost by the gas is used to vaporize the water.  
   \[ Q_{gas} = m_g c_g (T_1 - T_2) \]  
