\[
\lambda_{\text{eff}} = \frac{\lambda}{n_c - n_c'}
\]  
where:  
- \(\lambda\) is the wavelength of light.  
- \(n_c\) is the refractive index of the core.  
- \(n_c'\) is the refractive index of the cladding.  

